    "detailed_description": "The final project for a team of high school seniors as part of their game design class, Chrono Clone is a free to play first-person puzzle platformer with multiple levels.<br><br>Explore the mysterious world of Chrono Clone in this brand-new puzzle-action platformer! A science experiment gone horribly wrong has left you stranded between time and you must find your way back to your own timeline. To do this you must:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Push buttons!<br></li><li> Move boxes!<br></li><li> Solve puzzles!<br></li><li> Avoid traps and angry robots!<br></li><li> Rewind time to create time clones of yourself!<br></li><li> Use clones of your past selves to assist you!</li></ul>",
